# Definition Of Done

Phase 16 is complete when:

Land Registry integration exists.

EPC integration exists.

Planning integration exists.

Auction feeds exist.

Comparable sales exist.

Rental intelligence exists.

Market intelligence feeds exist.

Property watch service exists.

Data quality monitoring exists.

Data source monitoring exists.

Feed dashboard exists.

The platform continuously gathers intelligence automatically.

---

# Why This Phase Matters

This phase changes the platform from:

### Analysis Platform

to

### Intelligence Platform

Most competitors analyse information after users provide it.

The Property Investment Intelligence Platform actively acquires intelligence.

This dramatically increases value and creates a significant competitive advantage.

